"**Note**: Contexts are matched only on one level at a time. So it is "
"possible to use the expression `\"Editor && vim_mode == normal\"`, but "
"`\"Workspace && vim_mode == normal\"` will never match because we set the "
"vim context at the `\"Editor\"` level."
